@startuml
!include _style.iuml
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam ClassAttributeFontSize 16
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
left to right direction
title Class view · Intake DTOs and the edit-specific pin\nAs built at 76282d3
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/media/services/direct_intake.py#L22
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/media/upload_models.py#L64
class "ReserveRequest (direct_intake)" as R <<Pydantic DTO>> $MEDIA {
 + request_id: UUID
 + filename: str
 + content_type: str
 + size_bytes: int
 + sha256: str
}
class "FinalizeRequest (direct_intake)" as F <<Pydantic DTO>> $MEDIA {
 + request_id: UUID
}
class "SourceVersion (media.upload_models)" as S <<ORM>> $MEDIA {
 + asset_id: UUID
 + bucket: str
 + key: str
 + version_id: str
 + sha256: str
 + size_bytes: int
 + content_type: str
}
R -[hidden]right- F
F -[hidden]right- S
skinparam LegendFontSize 16
legend bottom
+ public; - internal by Python convention; underlined = class/module scope.
Reserve/finalize accept these DTOs. Upload pins stay on UploadReservation; only derived edits create SourceVersion.
Asset 1 -- 0..1 SourceVersion via asset_id FK. Selected fields reproduce source annotations, with Mapped[T] shown as T.
endlegend
@enduml
